<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Monochrome layer (DESIGN.md §11) for themed icons: the same plate, ticks and start line as one
    colour, no accent and no background band. Android tints this layer, so a second colour here would
    be dropped anyway — and would be a colour-only signal on a surface that has no colour.
-->
